    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδοθι</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>within, at home</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.58
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τά τ᾽ ἔ. καὶ τὰ θύρηφι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.220
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ δ᾽ ἔ. θυμὸν ἀμύξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.243
				</span></i>
			, etc.; rare in 
				Att.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. μέν ἐστι Πρωταγόρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					146a
				</span></i>
			 codd., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐελμένοι ἔ. πύργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.287
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. νήσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					76.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Op.</u>
					523
				</span></i>
			.</div>
